{
    "pageid": 139,
    "title": "Terra Normannorum",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Terra Normannorum is a mod with a meandering focus based on its creator's whims. It does aim to add major amounts of content, reshaping the game with a hopefully more historic feel. The optional segments, however, contain Alternative History, as this content is also an improved-upon port of the Vinland DW mod for Europa Universalis III."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Its features include:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Extended start date to the year 1000, with all that entails.",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "New Bookmarks:",
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "text": "1000.9.10 - Battle of Svolder",
                                            "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "text": "1001.2.1 - The Fifty Years' War",
                                            "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "text": "1003.3.15 - Nadir of Our Fortunes",
                                            "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "text": "1009.5.1 - The White Raven (Vinland-exclusive)",
                                            "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "text": "1030.7.29 - Stiklestad Aftermath",
                                            "children": []
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "text": "1034.5.11 - Years of Turmoil",
                                            "children": []
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "More widespread Pagans!",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "The highest tier rulers of the Russian Principalities, Poland and Hungary are Christian at this point, but all their vassals aren't.",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "The King of Sweden is 8 years away from his conversion to Christianity!",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New Religions!",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Ásatrú heresies ( Forn siðr and Nýi siðr . The latter becoming more like Christendom, the former returning to older ways).",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Pogányság (Hungarian paganism), Slavianstvo (Slavic paganism) and Judaism (Khazars).",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Midewiwin and native beliefs in the Vinland expansion.",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New Cultures!",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Historical Norsemen rather than the modern day ones in vanilla.",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Anglo-Norse in the Danelaw.",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Crimean Goths.",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Partially redesigned map with several new provinces.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Optional western expansion including a detailed Vinland to experience the conflicts between Norsemen and Skraelings as they first set foot in the New World!",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Removal of Empires besides the HRE, Byzantium, Persia and Arabia.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Overly obscure Easter Eggs!",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}